Epeira is a GNUstep Web Browser.
<br>

It allows to:

<ul>
<li>Manage Internet ShortLinks: use, edit and add ones;</li>
<li>Perform a Search by Key Words on the Web: the defaut SearchPage is provided  
by Duckduckgo Search Engine.</li>
</ul>

It also provides a simplified kind of History.
<br>
Password management is provided with <b>Pass.app</b>.
<br>
<Under the hoods: it uses an xembeded Surf instance, which provides a  
complete Gtk-WebKit engine.
